id: technique-block
name: Technique Block
uaType: both
prerequisite: Insight Score of 8+
tpCost: 4
type: counter
actionCost: 1
# "Upon gaining this Unique Ability, select a Signature Technique you are aware of" - its name written in the Unique
# Ability's body exactly as the Technique is named, and matched against the attack's (the user's ruling). "When you are
# targeted by that Signature Technique, you may use this Unique Ability to reduce that Signature Technique's Strike Roll
# to 0" - answered from Respond; "The Ki Point Cost of this Unique Ability is equal to 1/2 of the Ki Point Cost of your
# selected Signature Technique" - its maker's, rounded down (chat.mjs playTechniqueBlock).
techniqueBlock: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Counter against one Signature Technique, named: its Strike Roll is 0. KP: half that Technique's.
text: >
  Technique Block: Petty and vindictive, you have specialized in preventing a specific technique from working against
  you.
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 4
  –KP Cost: Varies
  –Maneuver Type: Counter
  –Action Cost: 1 Counter Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Upon gaining this Unique Ability, select a Signature Technique you are aware of. When you are targeted by
  that Signature Technique, you may use this Unique Ability to reduce that Signature Technique’s Strike Roll is to 0.

  The Ki Point Cost of this Unique Ability is equal to 1/2 of the Ki Point Cost of your selected Signature Technique.
